for loop is used to iterate over elements. it is similar to while loop 

elements = ["giraffe", "horse", "lion"]

for element in elements:
    print(element)

match case is used for control flow based on case matching

text = input("Enter the text ")

match text:
    case "A":
        print("A")
    case "B":
        print("B")
    case "exit":
        break       
    case _:
        print("doesn't match")

python is converted by  cpython - interpretor into machine language 